          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakubilela kumatu ami nezu deneni, nindi, Kundamishaku kwakwihi antu ahembaŋa mukala, wejima wawu enzi nayitwa yawu yakujilumuna nachu kumakasawu, iwu nachindi, iwu nachindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami nitali, amayala atanu nawumu hiyakufuma kunjila yakuchisu chakundundamu chatala kukabeta kakuchimunswa, wejima wawu adi nayitwa yawu yakujahana nachu kumakasawu, iwu nachindi, iwu nachindi; mukachi kawu mwadiŋi iyala wavweli mahina amawahi, mumbunda yindi mwadiŋi luseŋu lwawulombu lwamukwakusoneka. Hiyakwijila, hiyakwimana kwakwihi nakameŋa kawuneŋu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.9.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.9.2",
